{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/20261127%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸終審法院<br/>► 1000　首席法官張舉能、常任法官李義、常任法官霍兆剛、常任法官林文瀚、非常任法官楊偉廉爵士<br/>自閉青年辱國旗罪成上訴至終院｜宣布判決</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳案　前夫、家翁及大伯否認謀殺罪｜續審<br/>► 0950　24庭　法官譚耀豪<br/>少年涉家中兩度強姦胞妹｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　25庭　暫委法官鄧少雄<br/>興達大廈大維修圍標案｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　裁判官鄭潤聰<br/>髮廊助理工作地點廁所外5度偷拍｜判刑<br/>利舞臺女廁棄嬰案　印傭被控兩罪｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　14庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>女教師涉音樂室襲擊女童｜再提堂</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T13:44:11.440023+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":374,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-http-error","origin":"wordpress-public-posts","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T13:21:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T18:57:33.422133+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T13:37:15.976811+00:00","content_hash":"29682978576006847aae2d515f331393cacc1b0991fddc2663e6f98ca0f5d19a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 520","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}